    "detailed_description": "Messier 111 is a twin-stick shooter that will test your skills.<br>Continue to take down enemies that are endlessly coming at you and try to survive longer.<br>You must avoid all attacks. Getting hit means the end.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use two different shots to destroy the enemies.<br></li><li> Survival time is everything: 30 seconds of estimated time per play to as much as you want.(depending on you!)<br></li><li> Avoid flying bullets and enemies with tact and reflexes. One hit is fatal.<br></li><li> There are more than 10 different types of enemies that will attack you.<br></li><li> Gain experience orbs dropped by enemies to strengthen your ship. Quick reinforcement gives you a survival advantage.<br></li><li> You have a buddy who can be used to follow and cover you, or place in a fixed position to use as a turret.<br></li><li> Release the overdrive energy and wipe out enemies.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Messier 111 is a twin-stick shooter that will test your skills.<br>Continue to take down enemies that are endlessly coming at you and try to survive longer.<br>You must avoid all attacks. Getting hit means the end.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use two different shots to destroy the enemies.<br></li><li> Survival time is everything: 30 seconds of estimated time per play to as much as you want.(depending on you!)<br></li><li> Avoid flying bullets and enemies with tact and reflexes. One hit is fatal.<br></li><li> There are more than 10 different types of enemies that will attack you.<br></li><li> Gain experience orbs dropped by enemies to strengthen your ship. Quick reinforcement gives you a survival advantage.<br></li><li> You have a buddy who can be used to follow and cover you, or place in a fixed position to use as a turret.<br></li><li> Release the overdrive energy and wipe out enemies.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Messier 111 is a twin-stick shooter that will test your skills.",
